# Files that must NOT be sent to Docker at build time.
# Without this file, a .venv / target / .git directory inside dags/ is copied into the
# image AND hashed by Cosmos on every DAG parse (that is what caused
# "DagBag import timeout for dags/dbt_olist.py").
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
dags/dbt/olist/target
dags/dbt/olist/logs
dags/dbt/olist/dbt_packages
dags/dbt/olist/.user.yml
.astro
.git
.idea
.vscode
tests
*.log
